'''Saw''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 3]] or through [[trading]].

== Appearance ==
It resembles a light gray futuristic saw, hence the name. It has a long blade with light blue streaks and small circular beam lights. Along the edge of the blade are small, bumpy ridges, and the tip of the blade is smooth and curved. The guard is black with a carbon texture, and the handle is light gray with a cutlass style.

== Trivia ==
* This + 100 [[Gifts 2015|Gifts]] were used to craft [[Handsaw]] during the [[Christmas Event 2015|2015 Christmas Event]].
*It has a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] counterpart under the name [[Chroma Saw]], which can be found in the same box.
*It is the least wanted out of all crate godlies.
*Its model derives from the Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/170903610/Intergalactic-Sword Intergalactic Sword], purchasable from the avatar shop for 500 Robux.
*When salvaged, it provides 32 godly [[shards]].

